<title>ITALY: Alitalia '96 losses 1.3 trln lire -- Ciampi.</title>
<headline>Alitalia '96 losses 1.3 trln lire -- Ciampi.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian national airline Alitalia is expected to see 1996 losses of around 1.3 trillion lire ($790 million), Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
